---
import Page from "$layouts/Page.astro";
import PostList from "$components/PostList.astro";
import { publishedPosts } from "../lib/posts";
import { kSiteTitle } from "$consts";
const posts = await publishedPosts();
---
<Page title={kSiteTitle}>
  <section class="intro">
    <h1>{kSiteTitle}</h1>
    <p>无论是愤怒、喜悦还是悲伤，全都倾注其中。</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-label="最近文章"><h2>最近文章</h2><PostList posts={posts.slice(0, 5)} /></section>
  <p><a href="/posts/">全部文章 →</a></p>
</Page>
